  "notes": [
    "Hardware mod matrix has no MIDI write path (MatrixBoard precedent): matrix edges in this plugin are SOFTWARE routing, not the synth's internal matrix.",
    "Device policy carried from v5: require named MicroFreak port (never fall back to first MIDI output); minimum 20ms between sends; verify one parameter on hardware before trusting the rest.",
    "Software-matrix demo edge (our layer, not the MF internal matrix): LFO sine 2Hz -> cutoff depth 0.4; runs only on Start."
  ],
